  "formalized": {
    "segment_composition": "E_AB = E_A and E_B; G_AB = G_A or (E_A and G_B), with identity, associativity, and an append theorem for aligned digit-pair segments.",
    "mode_formula": "At a base leaf, project iff target equals branch; constant one iff the first mismatch is target middle and branch right; otherwise constant zero.",
